# Admin roadmap (flower-shop)

Do this in order. Do not jump to analytics, roles, or payments until the current step is done.

## Done / in progress
- Catalog, cart, checkout (name + phone)
- Admin tabs: dashboard, flowers, orders, write-offs
- `/admin` + cookie auth on `/api/admin/*`
- Order fields: address, delivery slot, comment; order search + auto-refresh
- Clickable dashboard (new/in-progress/low stock) + last 5 orders with “take in progress”
- Inline stock/price in flowers table; bulk hide/show; category dictionary
- Stock inbound from CSV/Excel + low-stock purchase list

## Next
1. Order assembly checklist + printable slip
2. Client history by phone
3. Real roles (seller vs owner) and change log
4. Optional: payment mark, WhatsApp/Telegram ping, delivery slots capacity

## Do not
- Put the admin password in client code
- Keep admin UI on the storefront `/` page
- Ship stub tabs (analytics/categories/inventory/changes) until they have APIs
